<mjml>
  <mj-head>
    <mj-attributes>
      <mj-text align="center" color="#202020" font-family="Sora, Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, sans-serif" />
      <mj-section background-color="#fff" />
      <mj-button
        background-color="#7a00b8"
        color="#fff"
        font-family="bernhard-gothic-urw, Sora, Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, sans-serif"
        font-size="20px"
        font-weight="bold"
        text-transform="uppercase"
        inner-padding="20px 22px"
        line-height="1.3"
      />
    </mj-attributes>
    <mj-font name="bernhard-gothic-urw" href="https://use.typekit.net/bjy5uxp.css" />
    <mj-font name="Sora" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Sora:wght@400;700&display=swap" />
    <mj-preview
      >The Battlepets Token Airdrop has begun! Check out the instructions on our X/Twitter to get your share of 3% of
      the BPETS token supply! The more points you get, the bigger your airdrop!</mj-preview
    >
    <mj-style>@media screen and (max-width: 480px) { .heading-text div { font-size: 28px !important; } } </mj-style>
    <mj-title>It’s Airdrop Time!</mj-title>
  </mj-head>

  <mj-body background-color="#f8eeff">
    <mj-section background-color="#4e0075" padding-bottom="0">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-image
          href="https://www.battlepets.io"
          width="80px"
          src="https://imagedelivery.net/tQX6spJrZdgf00cBsxL4kQ/3e1bb9cc-3078-4c49-42e4-577b8996d000/public"
          alt="Battlepets logo"
          padding-top="0"
        />
        <mj-text
          css-class="heading-text"
          align="center"
          color="#fff"
          font-family="bernhard-gothic-urw, Sora, Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, sans-serif"
          font-size="36px"
          font-weight="bold"
          line-height="1.3"
          >It’s <span style="color: #d000ff">Airdrop</span> Time!</mj-text
        >
        <mj-image
          width="600px"
          src="https://imagedelivery.net/tQX6spJrZdgf00cBsxL4kQ/e98509a8-55b7-4b24-1a5f-e5be39168000/public"
          alt="Battlepets cards"
          padding="0"
        />
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>
    <mj-section>
      <mj-column padding-left="6.5%" padding-right="6.5%" padding-bottom="30px">
        <mj-text font-size="16px" line-height="1.5" align="left">
          <p>Hey, the <strong>Battlepets Token Airdrop</strong> has finally begun!</p>
          <p>
            Signups are open, and <strong>3% of the BPETS token supply</strong> will be distributed by all participants
            right after our token launch!</br>This is a weighted airdrop, so <strong>the more points you get, the bigger your
            share</strong>!
          </p>
          <p>
            Check out our <a href="https://twitter.com/battlepets_game/status/1796938563705012661" style="color: #7a00b8; font-weight: bold; text-decoration: underline">X/Twitter post</a> about the airdrop for instructions on how to sign up, and also refer other people!
          </p>
          <p>You might also get your hands on a limited edition <strong><span style="color: #16807d">Blizzard</span> Winterwind</strong> NFT card by doing a simple extra task!
        </mj-text>
        <mj-image
          width="280px"
          src="https://imagedelivery.net/tQX6spJrZdgf00cBsxL4kQ/1620e236-014e-4949-4767-ed4eb6d85900/public"
          alt="Blizzard Winterwind card"
          padding="0"
        />
        <mj-text font-size="16px" line-height="1.5" align="left">
          <p>Good luck! We’ll keep you posted with any other updates!</p>
        </mj-text>
        <mj-button href="https://twitter.com/battlepets_game/status/1796938563705012661">Get The Airdrop</mj-button>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>
    <mj-section background-color="#f8eeff" padding-bottom="4px">
      <mj-group>
        <mj-column>
          <mj-image
            href="https://t.me/battlepets_game"
            alt="Telegram logo"
            align="right"
            height="44px"
            width="44px"
            padding-left="6px"
            padding-right="6px"
            src="https://imagedelivery.net/tQX6spJrZdgf00cBsxL4kQ/c5e8f177-28e1-4f92-3380-36f34a961d00/public"
          />
        </mj-column>
        <mj-column>
          <mj-image
            href="https://twitter.com/battlepets_game"
            alt="X logo"
            align="left"
            padding-left="6px"
            padding-right="6px"
            height="44px"
            width="44px"
            src="https://imagedelivery.net/tQX6spJrZdgf00cBsxL4kQ/aef63962-4b4b-47b0-b518-1110a8ebdd00/public"
          />
        </mj-column>
      </mj-group>
    </mj-section>
    <mj-section
      background-color="#f8eeff"
      padding-top="0"
      padding-left="10px"
      padding-right="10px"
      padding-bottom="40px"
    >
      <mj-column>
        <mj-text color="#883fbc" font-size="12px" padding="2px" line-height="1.5"
          >Sent by
          <a href="https://www.battlepets.io" style="color: #d000ff; text-decoration: underline">Battlepets</a
          >.</mj-text
        >
        <mj-text color="#883fbc" font-size="12px" padding="2px" line-height="1.5"
          >© 2024 Battlepets. All rights reserved. |
          <a
            href="{{{ pm:unsubscribe }}}"
            style="
              color: #d000ff;
              font-family:
                Sora,
                Helvetica Neue,
                Helvetica,
                sans-serif;
              text-decoration: underline;
            "
            >Unsubscribe</a
          >
        </mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>
  </mj-body>
</mjml>
